            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.14+MRK.16.15+MRK.16.16+MRK.16.17+MRK.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mrk 16:14-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.36+LUK.24.37+LUK.24.38+LUK.24.39+LUK.24.40+LUK.24.41+LUK.24.42+LUK.24.43+LUK.24.44+LUK.24.45+LUK.24.46+LUK.24.47+LUK.24.48+LUK.24.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 24:36-49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko kur’ uwo musi buhwibiriye, ni wo musi wa mbere w’imisi ndwi, inzugi zāri zugaye ah’ abigishwa bari, kubgo gutinya Abayuda, Yesu araza abahagarara hagati, arababgira, at’ Amahoro abe muri mwebge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaze kuvuga artyo, abereka ibiganza vyiwe no mu rubavu. Maz’ abigishwa baranezerwa, babonye Umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 17:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yongera kubabgira, at’ Amahoro abe muri mwebge. Nk’uko Data yantumye ni ko nanje mbatumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
