            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw ibi vyandikiwe kugira ngo mwizere yuko Yesu ari we Kristo, Umwana w’Imana, no kugira ngo mwizeye mugire ubugingo mw izina ryiwe.",
          "type": "text",
